# Stela API (Part 2 placeholders)

```
Base URL (prod):  https://stela-mobile.web.app/api/
Auth header:      Authorization: Bearer <Firebase ID Token>  (via Dio interceptor)
```

Public: `GET /health`. Authenticated: `/auth/*`, `/stories/*`, `/sessions/*`, `/streak*`, `/badges`, `/xp/*`.
